# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Docker build context exclusions.
#
# This file matters more than usual here: the repository is ~700 MB on disk
# (412 MB of git history alone, 190 MB of model_registry, 66 MB of duplicated
# model_artifacts, 30 MB of training CSVs). Without these rules every
# `docker build` uploads all of it to the daemon before running a single
# instruction, and every CI build pays that cost again.
#
# Both images build from the repo root, so the rules below are the union of
# what neither image needs. The Dockerfiles still COPY explicit paths — this
# file is for build speed, the COPY lines are for correctness.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── VCS and tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
**/.DS_Store
*.log

# ── Local env / secrets — must never be baked into a layer ───────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Node ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules
dist
.vite

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.venv
venv
htmlcov
.coverage

# ── Training data and pipeline (~30 MB) — inference never reads these ────────
ml_training/

# ── Flutter mobile shell — built and shipped separately, not by these images ─
mobile/

# ── Legacy duplicate of variant_1 artifacts (~66 MB) ─────────────────────────
# backend/main.py only falls back to model_artifacts/ when the registry lookup
# fails. The image ships a known-good registry variant and asserts it loaded at
# startup, so the fallback copy is dead weight.
model_artifacts/

# ── Model registry: ship the serving variant only ────────────────────────────
# variant_2 and variant_3 are permanently "archived" in registry.json and
# variant_4 only ever loads when it is itself the pinned ACTIVE_VARIANT_ID.
# Shipping just variant_1 keeps ~124 MB out of the context and the image.
#
# To ship a different variant instead, change the negation below AND the
# ACTIVE_VARIANT_ID default in backend/Dockerfile.
model_registry/*
!model_registry/registry.json
!model_registry/variant_1/**

# ── Infra / docs that never belong in an image ───────────────────────────────
infra/
supabase/
docs/
README.md
render.yaml
